                  "id": "Ll8h4",
                  "name": "P",
                  "fill": "$v4-body",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "Flow is usually light-to-none now, so a thinner pad keeps you comfortable. Stay hydrated and add iron-rich foods to rebuild after your period.",
